  "youtube": {
    "title": "Stop Waiting To Feel Motivated.",
    "description": "Day 1 he felt unstoppable. Day 4 it rained, and the feeling never came back.\n\nA short animated story about motivation vs. discipline. Motivation is a feeling, and feelings don't show up on schedule. Discipline is doing the thing anyway: tired, bored, not feeling it.\n\nIf you keep waiting to feel ready:\n• Make the rule tiny. \"Shoes on, run to the corner\" beats \"run 5 miles\".\n• Decide once, not every morning. Same time, same place.\n• Tell one person. Someone who checks in makes skipping harder.\n\nDon't wait to feel ready.\n\nIf this helped, share it with someone who needs it, and subscribe for more.\n\n#discipline #motivation #selfimprovement #habits #running #animation #mindset",
    "tags": [
